                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "When a horde of Pokémon popped out, he just stood there watching them..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "tierno",
            "lines": [
                "Well, yeah, Trevs! Coming up with the world's best Pokémon dance IS my dream, after all!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "tierno",
            "lines": [
                "I was born to dance! I won't ever stop! Not with moves like this!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "That's indeed a perfect dream for you, Tierno."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "I guess I should show just as much dedication to my dream of completing the Pokédex, then!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "It's good to be serious about some things!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'Oh, uh, ' + q.player.username + '? Do take this Honey, wont you?';"
